<item>
            <title>[LU-20654] sanity-lnet test_110 intermittently fails when configuring o2ib NI by NID</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20654</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;sanity-lnet test_110&lt;/tt&gt; intermittently fails when recreating an o2ib NI using:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;lnetctl net add --nid &amp;lt;nid&amp;gt;@o2ib&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The failure is:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;{{kiblnd_startup(): ko2iblnd: No matching interfaces&lt;br/&gt;
Error -100 starting up LNI o2ib}}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In &lt;tt&gt;kiblnd_startup()&lt;/tt&gt;, the valid supplied NID is cleared while determining the default interface. Interface selection then depends on enumeration order and may select the wrong interface.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
